<body data-time="all">
  <header class="site"><div class="wrap bar"><a class="brand" href="/">Vault <b>Human</b></a><nav class="navlinks" id="navlinks"><a href="/method/">The approach</a><div class="navdrop"><button class="navdrop__btn" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="true">Your life <span aria-hidden="true">▾</span></button><div class="navdrop__menu"><a href="/as-learned/">Learning your past</a><a href="/as-loved/">Loving your present</a><a href="/as-lived/">Living your future</a></div></div><a href="/writing/">Writing</a><a href="/speaking/">About</a><a href="/plans/">Plans</a><a class="btn btn-acc" href="https://buy.stripe.com/fZu8wP9Jl9fO1d2dqU6Na00">Begin</a></nav><button class="navtoggle" type="button" aria-label="Open menu" aria-controls="navlinks" aria-expanded="false"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button></div></header>
  <main>
    <section class="hero hero-plain"><div class="wrap hero-grid"><div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">The 88 · keys for the heart</p>
      <h1>Eighty-eight keys. <em>Each one for love.</em></h1>
      <p class="lede">The mind has its 360 keys and the body its 180. The heart has 88: eight in each chamber, arriving every fourth morning. They move from love for who you are, to the people near you, to love given away.</p>
      <div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="https://buy.stripe.com/fZu8wP9Jl9fO1d2dqU6Na00">Begin with Vault</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="#chambers">See the chambers</a></div>
    </div></div></section>
    <section class="sec fk" style="padding-top:12px"><div class="wrap fk-grid">
      <div class="fk-copy"><p class="eyebrow">The first heart key</p><h2>Stay in love.</h2><p class="lede">Love is something you stay in, whether or not it comes back. The 88 begins there.</p><p class="fk-link"><a href="/key/h001/">Read the first heart key</a></p></div>
      <div class="fk-vid"><video controls playsinline preload="metadata" poster="/img/keys/h001-stay-in-love-cover.jpg"><source src="/video/h001-stay-in-love.mp4" type="video/mp4" /></video></div>
    </div></section>
    <style is:inline>
      .fk-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:36px;align-items:center}
      .fk-copy h2{margin:6px 0 10px}
      .fk-link{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;margin:14px 0 0}.fk-link a{color:var(--acc-soft);text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(143,166,126,.5)}
      .fk-vid video{display:block;width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:12px;background:#000;border:1px solid rgba(143,166,126,.3);box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}
      @media(max-width:860px){.fk-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:22px}}
    </style>
    <style is:inline>
      .hwheel .kw-dots circle{fill:#E4A99A!important}
    </style>
    <section class="sec" style="padding-top:20px"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="ck-steps">
        <div><span>01</span><b>It arrives</b><p>Every fourth morning, a heart key comes with your mind key: a short video and one small step.</p></div>
        <div><span>02</span><b>You carry it</b><p>It stays with you for four days, until the next one comes.</p></div>
        <div><span>03</span><b>You notice it</b><p>One line: where you brought love today, and what you appreciated instead of expected.</p></div>
        <div><span>04</span><b>It opens</b><p>Eight in a chamber, and the heart opens a little wider before the next room.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div></section>
    <section class="sec" style="padding-top:20px"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">The Vault Approach</p><h2>88 keys. Eleven rooms.</h2><p class="lede">Eight in every room. A heart key arrives every fourth morning, in the room you are in.</p></div>
